                     <title>Novum testamentum, etc.</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">A label formerly attached to the cover is now
                        pasted inside: "In hoc volumine continetur totum/ testamentum nouum cum
                        dulpici/ translacione super psalterium quod/ quidem volumen pertinet ad
                        wi/chelcombense monasterium."</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
