                  <provenance type="#e"><orgName role="fmo" key="org_589">Winchcombe,
                        Gloucestershire. Benedictine abbey of St Kenelm</orgName><p>"Liber sacre
                        winchelcumbensis monasterii Bibliothece ex dono Reuerendi patris dompni
                        Richardi Kyderminster olim eiusdem loci abbatis" in a careful humanistic
                        hand on verso of first old flyleaf.</p></provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">Old Royal Library.</provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">"No [...]" (at head of fol. 1r).</provenance>
